 sizes=\"94x94\" />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"https://www.lensculture.com/assets/favicon-43da28dd2a7081201e6acc0c70d2d9135214c93f3a92b7b41fb51e111d349a8c.ico\" />\n\n<title>Tobias Titz | LensCulture</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tobias is a freelance photographer based in Melbourne, Australia.\nOver the last  15 years he has worked for a range of local and international magazines and commercial clients.\nHe also likes to make sure he has time to focus on his personal projects such as the award winning Polaroid project.\n\nTobias is passionate about all aspects of people and portrait photography. He particularly enjoys capturing people in their own surroundings – even if that means traveling to remote locations in the Australian outback.\n\nHis work has been exhibited internationally and are held in public and private collections in Australia, Europe and the USA.\n\nTobias won a first prize at the international Polaroid Award in 2000, the Head On Photography Prize in 2008, the Moran Contemorary Photography Prize in 2012, the Art handler&#39;s Award at the National Photographic Portrait Prize 2017 and the People&#39;s Choice Award at the Martin Kantor portrait Prize 2023. \">\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Tobias Titz | LensCulture\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.lensculture.com/tobias-titz\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tobias Titz | LensCulture\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"profile\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://images.lensculture.com/image/7ecc62bf-96bc-4512-eef3-2c8f28faa300/thumb\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Tobias is a freelance photographer based in Melbourne, Australia.\nOver the last  15 years he has worked for a range of local and international magazines and commercial clients.\nHe also likes to make sure he has time to focus on his personal projects such as the award winning Polaroid project.\n\nTobias is passionate about all aspects of people and portrait photography. He particularly enjoys capturing people in their own surroundings – even if that means traveling to remote locations in the Australian outback.\n\nHis work has been exhibited internationally and are held in public and private collections in Australia, Europe and the USA.\n\nTobias won a first prize at the international Polaroid Award in 2000, the Head On Photography Prize in 2008, the Moran Contemorary Photography Prize in 2012, the Art handler&#39;s Award at the National Photographic Portrait Prize 2017 and the People&#39;s Choice Award at the Martin Kantor portrait Prize 2023. \">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.lensculture.com/tobias-titz\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"LensCulture\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@lensculture\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@lensculture\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.lensculture.com/tobias-titz\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Tobias Titz | LensCulture\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Tobias is a freelance photographer based in Melbourne, Australia.\nOver the last  15 years he has worked for a range of local and international magazines and commercial clients.\nHe also likes to make sure he has time to focus on his personal projects such as the award winning Polaroid project.\n\nTobias is passionate about all aspects of people and portrait photography. He particularly enjoys capturing people in their own surroundings – even if that means traveling to remote locations in the Australian outback.\n\nHis work has been exhibited internationally and are held in public and private collections in Australia, Europe and the USA.\n\nTobias won a first prize at the international Polaroid Award in 2000, the Head On Photography Prize in 2008, the Moran Contemorary Photography Prize in 2012, the Art handler&#39;s Award at the National Photographic Portrait Prize 2017 and the People&#39;s Choice Award at the Martin Kantor portrait Prize 2023. \">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://images.lensculture.com/image/7ecc62bf-96bc-4512-eef3-2c8f28faa300/thumb\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:domain\" content=\"www.lensculture.com\">\n\n<meta property=\"fb:app_id\" content=\"\">\n<meta property=\"fb:pages\" content=\"14562082367\">\n\n\n\n    <link rel=\"preload\" as=\"style\" media=\"all\" href=\"https://www.lensculture.com/assets/application-c66b337fecdc6c09388a3e948623af0fd5152c71c2b9f4629a9caae4cda5f27e.css\">\n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://www.lensculture.com/assets/application-c66b337fecdc6c09388a3e948623af0fd5152c71c2b9f4629a9caae4cda5f27e.css\" media=\"all\" />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://www.lensculture.com/assets/consent-7fb50319b9d93f25de34d2ad8eca7cfbf604cbb847dc6ead99d36e47b9584c4b.css\" media=\"all\" />\n\n\n\n\n\n<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.7.1.min.js\" data-cfasync=\"false\"></script>\n<script src=\"//use.typekit.net/cgg5lpx.js\" data-cfasync=\"false\"></script>\n\n\n<script>\n  try{Typekit.load();}catch(e){}\n</script>\n\n  </head>\n  <body class=\"artist-pages-layout    en-lang  guest\" lang='en'>\n\n    <div class=\"main-wrap \">\n      <div class=\"artist-main \">\n          <header\n  class=\"\n    navbar \n    \n  \"\n  \n>\n  <div class=\"background\"></div>\n  \n    <a class=\"db flexible items-center justify-center white fw6 relative competition-alert alert alert-dismissible fade in\" href=\"/photo-competitions/photobook\" title=\"Check out our Photography Competition 2026 &amp; Photo Awards now.\">\n    <b>\n      Photobook Prize 2026\n        &ndash;\n        <span class=\"ttu\"> Deadline</span>\n        August 12, 2026\n    </b>\n    <span class=\"dib fw7 ttu ba b--white pv2 ph3\">Submit Project</span>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"alert\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&times;</span>\n    </button>\n  