pe fa-md\"></i>\n              </a>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  window.profile_page_username = \"tobias-titz\";\n</script>\n\n\n      <div class=\"featured-project-photos\">\n        <div id=\"wrap-slider\" class=\"royalSlider rsDefault\">\n            <a class=\"rsImg\" href=\"https://photos.lensculture.com/medium/0e5c749f-f9db-4390-8f47-e3f385f5588e.jpg\"></a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"wrap-featured-project-info\">\n          <div class=\"featured-project-title\">\n            <a data-modal-viewer=\"project-1397427\" href=\"/projects/1397427-jilamara-artists-and-tobias-titz\">Jilamara Artists and Tobias Titz</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n          \n\n          <div class=\"container container-artist\">\n            \n<div class=\"wrap-artist-container\">\n  \n\n  \n\n  <div class=\"profile-detail\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n      <div class=\"profile-detail-stats pull-left\">\n          <div class=\"user-profile-photo\" style=\"background-image:url('https://images.lensculture.com/image/7ecc62bf-96bc-4512-eef3-2c8f28faa300/thumb')\"></div>\n        <div class=\"profile-buttons\">\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"clearfix\"></div>\n\n        <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n\n          <li>\n            <i class=\"fa fa-globe brand-url-icon\"></i><a title=\"www.tobiastitz.de\" class=\"website-link\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.tobiastitz.de\">tobiastitz.de</a>\n          </li>\n\n            <li>\n              <i class=\"fa fa-instagram brand-url-icon\"></i><a class=\"website-link\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/tobiastitzphotography/\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tobiastitzphotography/\">tobiastitzphotography</a>\n            </li>\n\n          <li>\n            \n          </li>\n\n          <li>\n            <a title=\"www.instagram.com/tobiastitzphotography\" class=\"website-link\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.instagram.com/tobiastitzphotography\">instagram.com/tobiastitzphotogr...</a>\n          </li>\n\n          <div class=\"user-sidebar-awards-info -profile\" data-max-height=\"90\">\n              <li class=\"module\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">Location:</div>\n                <div class=\"item-content\" itemprop=\"address\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/PostalAddress\">\n                  <span itemprop='addressLocality'>Melbourne</span>, <span itemprop='addressCountry'>Australia</span>\n                </div>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"module\">\n                <div class=\"item-title\">LensCulture Awards:</div>\n                  <div class=\"item-content\">\n                    <a class=\"award-link\" href=\"/2020-black-and-white-photography-award-winners\">Black &amp; White Photography Awards 2020</a>,\n                    Finalist\n                  </div>\n              </li>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"profile-detail-bio pull-right\">\n            <div class=\"profile-bio\">\n    <div class=\"subhead\">\n      About\n      Tobias Titz\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bio hidden-.text-collapsible-\">\n      <p>Tobias is a freelance photographer based in Melbourne, Australia.\n<br />Over the last  15 years he has worked for a range of local and international magazines and commercial clients.\n<br />He also likes to make sure he has time to focus on his personal projects such as the award winning Polaroid project.</p>\n\n<p>Tobias is passionate about all aspects of people and portrait photography. He particularly enjoys capturing people in their own surroundings – even if that means traveling to remote locations in the Australian outback.</p>\n\n<p>His work has been exhibited internationally and are held in public and private collections in Australia, Europe and the USA.</p>\n\n<p>Tobias won a first prize at the international Polaroid Award in 2000, the Head On Photography Prize in 2008, the Moran Contemorary Photography Prize in 2012, the Art handler's Award at the National Photographic Portrait Prize 2017 and the People's Choice Award at the Martin Kantor portrait Prize 2023. </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n        <!-- Featured on LensCulture: Articles and winner pages -->\n          <div class=\"section profile-featured-articles-winners-list\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Featured on LensCulture</div>\n            <ul class=\"list-unstyled articles-list\">\n                \n<li class=\"article-list-item\">\n  <div class=\"image-section\">\n    <a href=\"/2020-black-and-white-photography-award-winners\">\n        <img onerror=\"\" src=\"https://photos.lensculture.com/small/0e5c749f-f9db-4390-8f47-e3f385f5588e.jpg\" />\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-section\">\n    <div class=\"summary-head\">\n      <a href=\"/2020-black-and-white-photography-award-winners\">\n        Black &amp; White Photography Awards 2020\n</a>    </div>\n  </div>\n</li>\n\n            </ul>\n            <a class=\"view-more-articles pull-right\">\n              <span class=\"more-caption\">View more</span>\n              <span class=\"less-caption\">View less</span>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        <!-- End of Featured -->\n\n        <!-- Projects -->\n          <div class=\"section \">\n            <div class=\"title\">Tobias Titz's Projects on LensCulture</div>\n            <div class=\"content\">\n              <ul class=\"list-unstyled other-cover-project-photos\">\n                  <li class=\"other-cover profile-project-list-item\" data-project-id=\"1397427\">\n  <a data-modal-viewer=\"project-1397427\" href=\"/projects/1397427-jilamara-artists-and-tobias-titz\">\n    <img alt=\"Raymond Bush\" class=\"cover-photo\" src=\"https://photos.lensculture.com/cover/0e5c749f-f9db-4390-8f47-e3f385f5588e.jpg\" />\n</a>\n\